│ error. The fix will involve modifying the    │
│ resolve_uri method to treat local links as   │
│ relative paths instead of attempting to      │
│ resolve them as full URLs.                   │
│                                              │
│ Patch:                                       │
│                                              │
│                                              │
│  # modification 1                            │
│  [file]Lib/Sphinx/process.py[/file]          │
│  [original] def resolve_uri(self, uri,       │
│  relpath=None):                              │
│      if relpath is None:                     │
│          relpath = uri                       │
│      if not uri.startswith(('http://',       │
│  'https://')):                               │
│          uri = self.config.source_root + ur  │
│      try:                                    │
│          result = urllib3.urlparse(uri)      │
│          if result.netloc:                   │
│              return result.netloc            │
│          else:                               │
│              return uri                      │
│      except:                                 │
│          return uri                          │
│  [/original]                                 │
│  [patched] def resolve_uri(self, uri,        │
│  relpath=None):                              │
│      if relpath is None:                     │
│          relpath = uri                       │
│      if not uri.startswith(('http://',       │
│  'https://')):                               │
│          uri = self.config.source_root + ur  │
│      try:                                    │
│          result = urllib3.urlparse(uri)      │
│          if result.netloc:                   │
│              return result.netloc            │
│          else:                               │
│              # Treat local links as relativ  │
│  paths                                       │
│              return relpath                  │
│      except:                                 │
│          return relpath                      │
│  [/patched]                                  │
│                                              │
│                                              │
│ Explanation of Changes:                      │
│                                              │
│ The patched code modifies the resolve_uri    │
│ method to treat local links (those not       │
│ starting with http:// or https://) as        │
│ relative paths.  Specifically, it now        │
│ returns the relpath argument instead of      │
│ attempting to parse the URL and resolve it.  │
│ This ensures that local links are treated as │
│ relative paths within the Sphinx             │
│ documentation structure, resolving the issue │
│ of the Name or service not known error.      │
