│  .. _local-link: doesntexist                 │
│  [/patched]                                  │
│                                              │
│                                              │
│ This patch adds a check within the           │
│ resolve_uri function to see if the link      │
│ starts with ... If it does, it assumes it’s  │
│ a relative link and prepends the base_url to │
│ it. Otherwise, it adds a / before the link,  │
│ ensuring it's treated as a relative path.    │
│ This resolves the issue of linkcheck failing │
│ to resolve local links.                      │
